
================================================================================
                   THE LOWER QUADRANT
================================================================================

In the lower quadrant of the graveyard, the land dips
slightly, and fog clings to the uneven ground.  The
gravestones here are modest and small, many leaning
with age, with inscriptions barely legible beneath
creeping ivy.

The air is damp and heavy, carrying the scent of wet
earth and decay.  The faint sound of trickling water
from an unseen stream accentuates the stillness.

================================================================================
                   SORTING DATA: sort
================================================================================

As you try to make sense of the gravestones, a spell
comes to your mind that could be helpful.

You can sort the gravestones by date with:

    sort gravestones

Once you do this, look for a familiar name and take
note of the year of death.  Add the year to your
inventory:

    export I=<year of death>,$I

